-> start
 
=== start ===
We were there to make sure the sentence was carried out. He claimed to be the Son of God. It was blasphemy.
* [Did you see the darkness?] -> darkness
 
=== darkness ===
A strange gloom, yes. But the more significant event happened back at the Temple.
* [What happened at the Temple?] -> veil
 
=== veil ===
At the moment he died, the veil of the temple was torn in two from top to bottom. The Holy of Holies was exposed. It was a terrifying omen.
-> DONE